          "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"ff14-infobox ff14-content-box\"><div class=\"ff14-infobox--title\">巧手紫票</div><div class=\"ff14-infobox--img\"><img alt=\"065088.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/b/bc/065088.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">基本信息</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>类型：</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81\" title=\"货币\">货币</a></li><li><span>分类：</span>其他 - 能工巧匠</li><li><span>持有上限：</span>4000</li></ul></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">历史版本</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>添加版本：</span><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-6\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:6.0\" title=\"版本:6.0\">版本 6.0</a></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">各语言名称</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>日文名：</span>クラフタースクリップ:紫貨</li><li><span>英文名：</span>Purple Crafters' Scrip</li></ul></div></div>\n<p><span class=\"item-link size-20\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B7%A7%E6%89%8B%E7%B4%AB%E7%A5%A8\" title=\"巧手紫票\"><img alt=\"065088.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/thumb/b/bc/065088.png/20px-065088.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/thumb/b/bc/065088.png/30px-065088.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/b/bc/065088.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\"><span class=\"item-name\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">巧手紫票</a></span></span></span></span>是 <span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-6\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:6.0\" title=\"版本:6.0\">版本 6.0</a></span> 新增的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%83%BD%E5%B7%A5%E5%B7%A7%E5%8C%A0%E5%B7%A5%E7%A5%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"能工巧匠工票\">能工巧匠工票</a>，属于其他类<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81\" title=\"货币\">货币</a>，持有上限为4000。完成任务<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"67631\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E4%B8%80%E6%B5%81%E5%B7%A5%E5%8C%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C\" title=\"任务:一流工匠的新工作\">一流工匠的新工作</a></span></span></span></span>开放，通过交纳<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%94%B6%E8%97%8F%E5%93%81\" title=\"收藏品\">收藏品</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%80%81%E4%B8%BB%E9%A1%BE%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93\" title=\"老主顾交易\">老主顾交易</a>获得。兑换<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%98%E7%B1%8D\" title=\"秘籍\">秘籍</a>需要完成任务<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"66959\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E4%B8%80%E6%B5%81%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7\" title=\"任务:一流的工具\">一流的工具</a></span></span></span></span>。\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-3\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:3.0\" title=\"版本:3.0\">版本 3.0</a></span>田园郡的工票交易员及60级或更高工票交易需要完成<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"67634\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E6%96%B0%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E7%9A%84%E5%A4%A7%E9%97%A8\" title=\"任务:打开新世界的大门\">打开新世界的大门</a></span></span></span></span>才可开放。</li>\n<li><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-4\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:4.0\" title=\"版本:4.0\">版本 4.0</a></span>神拳痕的工票交易员及70级或更高工票交易需要完成<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"68477\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E7%94%9F%E6%84%8F%E5%85%B4%E9%9A%86%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E7%BD%97%E8%96%87%E5%A8%9C%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"任务:生意兴隆——罗薇娜商会\">生意兴隆——罗薇娜商会</a></span></span></span></span>才可开放。</li>\n<li><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-5\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:5.0\" title=\"版本:5.0\">版本 5.0</a></span>游末邦的工票交易员及80级或更高工票交易需要完成<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"69139\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E8%AF%9A%E4%BF%A1%E4%B8%BA%E6%9C%AC%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E8%8E%AB%E9%9B%AF%E5%8D%93%E8%B6%8A%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"任务:诚信为本——莫雯卓越商会\">诚信为本——莫雯卓越商会</a></span></span></span></span>才可开放。</li>\n<li><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-6\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:6.0\" title=\"版本:6.0\">版本 6.0</a></span>拉札罕的工票交易员及90级或更高工票交易需要完成<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"69711\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%84%E6%A8%A1%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E7%BD%97%E8%96%87%E5%A8%9C%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"任务:扩大规模——罗薇娜商会\">扩大规模——罗薇娜商会</a></span></span></span></span>才可开放。</li>\n<li><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-7\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:7.0\" title=\"版本:7.0\">版本 7.0</a></span>九号解决方案的工票交易员及100级或更高工票交易需要完成<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"70544\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E4%BA%A4%E6%98%93%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E7%BD%97%E8%92%82%E5%A8%9C%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"任务:新的交易——罗蒂娜商会\">新的交易——罗蒂娜商会</a></span></span></span></span>才可开放。</li></ul>\n<p>在 <span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-6\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:6.2\" title=\"版本:6.2\">版本 6.2</a></span> 中持有上限从2000提升到4000。\n</p><p>最初需要完成任务<span class=\"quest-link size-20 huiji-tt\" data-name=\"69711\" data-type=\"quest\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><span class=\"xivui-icon\" data-id=\"061419\" data-size=\"20\"></span></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\" style=\"padding-left:unset\"><span class=\"quest-name\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1:%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E8%A7%84%E6%A8%A1%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E7%BD%97%E8%96%87%E5%A8%9C%E5%95%86%E4%BC%9A\" title=\"任务:扩大规模——罗薇娜商会\">扩大规模——罗薇娜商会</a></span></span></span></span>开放。\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span id=\".E7.94.A8.E4.BA.8E.E5.85.91.E6.8D.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"用于兑换\">用于兑换</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/index.php?title=%E5%B7%A7%E6%89%8B%E7%B4%AB%E7%A5%A8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：用于兑换\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"&#91;&amp;:has(.ff14-spa-allinone)_.ff14-gadget-loading&#93;:hidden\"><div class=\"ff14-gadget-loading\"><div>\n<div class=\"ff14-loading\"></div><div>正在加载兑换列表，请稍候……</div>\n</div></div><div class=\"ff14-spa-allinone item-currency-exchange\" data-id=\"33913\"></div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023022924\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc‐conversion]\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0.001 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.525 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.828 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 289/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12336/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 59/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 9/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.472/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 38653197/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  760.669      1 -total\n 88.01%  669.500      1 模板:货币兑换列表V2\n  4.97%   37.78