          "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"ff14-infobox ff14-content-box\"><div class=\"ff14-infobox--title\">亚拉戈诗学神典石</div><div class=\"ff14-infobox--img\"><img alt=\"065023.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/b/b0/065023.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">基本信息</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>类型：</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81\" title=\"货币\">货币</a></li><li><span>分类：</span>战斗 - 亚拉戈神典石</li><li><span>持有上限：</span>2000</li></ul></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">历史版本</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>添加版本：</span><span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:2.4\" title=\"版本:2.4\">版本 2.4</a></span></li></ul></div><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block\"><div class=\"ff14-content-box-block--title\">各语言名称</div><hr /><ul class=\"img-v-align-baseline\"><li><span>日文名：</span>アラガントームストーン:詩学</li><li><span>英文名：</span>Allagan Tomestone of Poetics</li></ul></div></div>\n<p><span class=\"item-link size-20\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><span class=\"link-block\"><span class=\"item-icon size-20\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><span class=\"item-icon--img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%9A%E6%8B%89%E6%88%88%E8%AF%97%E5%AD%A6%E7%A5%9E%E5%85%B8%E7%9F%B3\" title=\"亚拉戈诗学神典石\"><img alt=\"065023.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/thumb/b/b0/065023.png/20px-065023.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/thumb/b/b0/065023.png/30px-065023.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/b/b0/065023.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"item-baseinfo\"><span class=\"item-name\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">亚拉戈诗学神典石</a></span></span></span></span>是 <span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:2.4\" title=\"版本:2.4\">版本 2.4</a></span> 新增的<a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%9A%E6%8B%89%E6%88%88%E7%A5%9E%E5%85%B8%E7%9F%B3\" title=\"亚拉戈神典石\">亚拉戈神典石</a>，属于战斗类<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%B4%A7%E5%B8%81\" title=\"货币\">货币</a>，持有上限为2000。通过<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%89%AF%E6%9C%AC\" title=\"副本\">副本</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%9A%8F%E6%9C%BA%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1\" title=\"随机任务\">随机任务</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AF%B9%E6%88%98\" title=\"对战\">对战</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%AF%BB%E5%AE%9D\" title=\"寻宝\">寻宝</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%80%AA%E7%89%A9%E7%8B%A9%E7%8C%8E\" title=\"怪物狩猎\">怪物狩猎</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B7%B1%E5%B1%82%E8%BF%B7%E5%AE%AB\" title=\"深层迷宫\">深层迷宫</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E5%9C%BA%E6%99%AF%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2\" title=\"特殊场景探索\">特殊场景探索</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%BF%B7%E5%AE%AB%E6%8E%A2%E7%B4%A2\" title=\"特殊迷宫探索\">特殊迷宫探索</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%8B%E5%A5%BD%E9%83%A8%E6%97%8F%E4%BB%BB%E5%8A%A1\" title=\"友好部族任务\">友好部族任务</a>、<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E4%B9%A6%E5%A5%87%E8%B0%88\" title=\"天书奇谈\">天书奇谈</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%81%87%E9%9D%A2%E7%8B%82%E6%AC%A2\" title=\"假面狂欢\">假面狂欢</a>获得。\n</p><p>在 <span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-2\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:2.5\" title=\"版本:2.5\">版本 2.57</a></span> 中，每周获取限制从450提升到900。\n</p><p>在 <span class=\"label label-hover label-patch-3\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%89%88%E6%9C%AC:3.0\" title=\"版本:3.0\">版本 3.0</a></span> 中取消每周获取限制。\n</p><p>最初用于兑换120品级的50级“加隆德装备”。\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"加隆德装备.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/thumb/5/5e/%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87.jpg/530px-%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"530\" height=\"298\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/5/5e/%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7%E8%A3%85%E5%A4%87.jpg 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"572\" data-file-height=\"322\" /></a>\n</p>\n<div class=\"ff-gallery\" style=\"width:100%\"><div id=\"gallery-ff-gallery\" class=\"blueimp-gallery blueimp-gallery-carousel blueimp-gallery-controls\"><div class=\"slides\"></div><div class=\"title\"></div><ol class=\"indicator\"></ol><div class=\"links hidden\" id=\"links\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV50IL110-%E7%9B%96%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%94%E7%89%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%B0%E4%BD%9C.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"武器-LV50IL110-盖罗尔特的杰作.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/f/fc/%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV50IL110-%E7%9B%96%E7%BD%97%E5%B0%94%E7%89%B9%E7%9A%84%E6%9D%B0%E4%BD%9C.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"2988\" height=\"1930\" data-file-width=\"2988\" data-file-height=\"1930\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV50IL120-%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"武器-LV50IL120-加隆德.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/4/45/%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV50IL120-%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3395\" height=\"1930\" data-file-width=\"3395\" data-file-height=\"1930\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E9%98%B2%E5%85%B7-LV50IL130-%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"防具-LV50IL130-加隆德.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/c/c7/%E9%98%B2%E5%85%B7-LV50IL130-%E5%8A%A0%E9%9A%86%E5%BE%B7.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3745\" height=\"2508\" data-file-width=\"3745\" data-file-height=\"2508\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV60IL230-%E8%9B%AE%E7%A5%9E%E9%A3%8E%E6%A0%BC.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"武器-LV60IL230-蛮神风格.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/ff14/uploads/6/6f/%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8-LV60IL230-%E8%9B%AE%E7%A5%9E%E9%A3%8E%E6%A0%BC.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"3395\" height=\"1930\" data-file-width=\"3395\" data-file-height=\"1930\" /></a><a href=\"